{"ticker":"CRL","updated":"2026-11-12T23:08:23Z","profile":{"longName":"Charles River Laboratories International, Inc.","shortName":"Charles River Laboratories Inte","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Diagnostics & Research","country":"United States","website":"https://www.criver.com","fullTimeEmployees":18300,"marketCap":16330752000,"trailingPE":370.44565,"forwardPE":26.276588,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.1064363,"pegRatio":0.12,"targetMeanPrice":346.07144,"targetHighPrice":400.0,"targetLowPrice":145.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":14,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.022,"earningsGrowth":5.236,"grossMargins":0.35097998,"operatingMargins":0.1427,"profitMargins":0.01011,"totalRevenue":3976867072,"beta":1.338,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":379.63,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":146.2,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Charles River Laboratories International, Inc. provides drug discovery, non-clinical development, and safety testing services in the United States, Europe, Canada, the Asia Pacific, and internationally. The Research Models and Services segment produces and sells rodents, and purpose-bred rats and mice for use by researchers. This segment also provides a range of services to assist its clients in supporting the use of research models in research and screening pre-clinical drug candidates, including genetically engineered models and services, insourcing solutions, and research animal diagnostic services; and engages in development and production of cell therapies. The Discovery and Safety Assessment segment offers in vitro and in vivo discovery services for the discovery, development, and safety testing of novel drugs, molecule compounds, oligonucleotides, and biotherapeutics, and antibodies through delivery of preclinical drug and therapeutic candidates ready for safety assessment; safety assessment services, such as toxicology, pathology, safety pharmacology, bioanalysis, drug metabolism, and pharmacokinetics services; and vivarium space services. The Manufacturing Solutions segment provides in vitro methods for conventional and rapid quality control testing of sterile and non-sterile pharmaceuticals and consumer products; offers specialized testing of biologics that are outsou","summary_zh":"Charles River Laboratories International, Inc. 在美國、歐洲、加拿大、亞太地區和國際上提供藥物發現、非臨床開發和安全測試服務。研究模型和服務部門生產和銷售囓齒動物以及專門飼養的大鼠和小鼠，供研究人員使用。該部門還提供一系列服務，協助客戶支援在研究和篩選臨床前候選藥物中使用研究模型，包括基因工程模型和服務、內包解決方案和研究動物診斷服務；並從事細胞療法的開發和生產。發現和安全評估部門透過提供臨床前藥物和治療候選藥物以進行安全評估，為新藥、分子化合物、寡核苷酸、生物治療藥物和抗體的發現、開發和安全測試提供體外和體內發現服務；安全評估服務，如毒理學、病理學、安全藥理學、生物分析、藥物代謝、藥物動力學服務；和動物園空間服務。製造解決方案部門提供無菌和非無菌藥品和消費品的常規和快速品質控制測試的體外方法；提供外部生物製品的專門測試","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"診斷與研究","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":153.05,"h":154.17,"l":151.64,"c":152.24,"v":470900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":150.56,"h":152.93,"l":149.9,"c":151.6,"v":775200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":151.6,"h":157.01,"l":151.27,"c":152.72,"v":1379200},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":155.0,"h":157.63,"l":153.47,"c":156.99,"v":716200},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":157.26,"h":157.95,"l":153.21,"c":155.39,"v":1280000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":154.49,"h":156.11,"l":151.41,"c":153.89,"v":1292300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":154.22,"h":154.94,"l":149.91,"c":150.25,"v":786800},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":150.13,"h":150.87,"l":147.46,"c":149.45,"v":1276200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":148.39,"h":148.39,"l":144.26,"c":145.57,"v":884200},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":146.0,"h":149.17,"l":145.32,"c":148.56,"v":762400},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":148.92,"h":148.92,"l":145.47,"c":146.99,"v":752600},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":147.54,"h":156.79,"l":146.9,"c":156.46,"v":1049300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":156.06,"h":170.66,"l":156.06,"c":170.48,"v":1292100},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":173.25,"h":178.19,"l":173.15,"c":175.36,"v":1714700},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":176.0,"h":181.45,"l":175.97,"c":177.33,"v":1112600},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":178.15,"h":179.64,"l":174.76,"c":174.95,"v":856800},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":175.23,"h":176.15,"l":168.32,"c":170.1,"v":900400},{"t":"2025-10-08","